----------------------------------------------------------------------
2.2 Hard progress stall
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Add:

    progressHardStallSeconds

At hard threshold:

First inspect whether the director has explicitly registered a legitimate
long-running operation.

If:

    activeOperation != null
and
    activeOperationExpectedUntil > now
and
